# 31_ganzfeld_amber_RGB.ledc — Eyes-Closed Ganzfeld (Amber/Red), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 31_ganzfeld_amber. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (pink field + 7 Hz theta
# underlay). The Ganzfeld effect needs a HOMOGENEOUS, unstructured field, so both rings
# (inner mask 9 + outer mask 6) show the SAME steady amber-red (255,40,0) — a uniform warm
# glow across the whole field, no flicker (freq 0). Steady red is safe (>=620 nm passes the
# closed eyelid). Brightness <=25%. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask   (freq 0 = steady uniform field)

# --- Ease-in: steady amber-red field + pink field + theta underlay fade in ---
0 0 100 >0 255 40 0 9            # inner: steady amber-red field, ease-in
0 0 100 >0 255 40 0 6            # outer: same amber-red (uniform Ganzfeld field)
A 0 200 0 >0 0 1 0 5              # ch1 pink-noise Ganzfeld field; vol fade-in
A 0 253 0 >0 0 2 260 0           # ch2 binaural 253 / R260 = 7 Hz theta underlay; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Eyes closed, gaze soft. Rest in the warm, even glow and the steady wash of sound."
15000 0 100 25 255 40 0 9        # inner: 25% cap
15000 0 100 25 255 40 0 6        # outer
A 60000 200 0 90 0 1 0 5          # ch1 pink field settled
A 60000 253 0 50 0 2 260 0        # ch2 theta underlay settled

# --- Stable hold: homogeneous field, no change ---
S 300000 default 65 "Let your eyes relax into the uniform field. Shapes and colours may begin to drift."
S 720000 default 65 "Nothing to seek. Just watch whatever arises in the glow."
S 1080000 default 65 "At ease, open, resting in the even light."

# --- Fade out: field + pink + underlay fade to 0 ---
1200000 0 100 >25 255 40 0 9     # inner: brightness ramp-out
1200000 0 100 >25 255 40 0 6     # outer
A 1200000 200 0 *90 0 1 0 5       # ch1 pink quad fade
A 1200000 253 0 *50 0 2 260 0     # ch2 theta quad fade
S 1200000 default 65 "Gently returning now. Let the glow and the sound fade away."
1320000 0 100 0 255 40 0 9       # inner off
1320000 0 100 0 255 40 0 6       # outer off
A 1320000 200 0 0 0 1 0 5         # pink 0
A 1320000 253 0 0 0 2 260 0       # theta 0
